{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"norway-employer-cost-calculator UI copy.details","detected_language":"sw","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"norway-employer-cost-calculator.copy.details","keys":["norway-employer-cost-calculator.copy.details"],"locale":"sw","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Calculator hutumia kuchapishwa ZXQPH0000QXZ eneo kiwango kwa ajili ya shughuli ya kawaida au kilimo / uvuvi. Inaongeza kuingia likizo malipo, fidia kodi na mchango wowote wa pensheni kwa msingi mchango. Kwa ajili ya shughuli ya kawaida katika eneo Ia, ZXQPH0001QXZ NOK kwa kila-biashara tofauti malipo ni kutumika kwa kiasi aliingia kama tayari kutumika mwaka huu. Matokeo ni makadirio ya kila mwaka mipango; mahali mfanyakazi aliyesajiliwa na shughuli kuamua sheria zinazotumika.","record_id":"c79bc34fcf6b629bacb12cb714c72af59ad49949a156ff08c4406f51403501b1","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40565692987","seconds":3.1529478389999213,"source":"The calculator uses the published 2026 zone rate for ordinary activity or agriculture/fishing. It adds entered holiday pay, taxable compensation and any pension contribution to the contribution basis. For ordinary activity in zone Ia, the 850,000 NOK per-enterprise differential allowance is applied to the amount entered as already used this year. Results are annual planning estimates; the employer’s registered location and activity determine the applicable rules.","source_commit":"e8a7cb94dc75d40f2c0e14bb27c0a1819e230012","source_hash":"8b288037e5ace5a06c2ac3508b1fb5530ef3639d3532d57a8cec85bb4567058f","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Calculator hutumia kuchapishwa 2026 eneo kiwango kwa ajili ya shughuli ya kawaida au kilimo / uvuvi. Inaongeza kuingia likizo malipo, fidia kodi na mchango wowote wa pensheni kwa msingi mchango. Kwa ajil